<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">2BIT ARUM</book>
  <para style="h">2 Abitrusu</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Abitrusu</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Abitrusu</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Bit</para>
  <para style="mt2">AMGBASHO ATA AFRI ANYI NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">Abitrusu</para>
  <para style="imt">IKPI TSIFA</para>
  <para style="im">Amgbasho Abitrusu ata na afri reh, ma a ŋa a na amboh tufa mboh ata jijii reh.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Amgbasho ata areh anyi na amya Siman Abitrusu, ahwra Yeso kristi, kyangwri sa tohmoh nana a bleh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">A na na amboh ata nza ma a bu ma aki tufa yehlehleh ata Nnoh ambohroh tasa Yeso Kristi nga reh hunji ajija nga agohsoh ta a bu ambohroh. Ma aki lisa alindeh Nnoh ambohroh Yeso Kristi ata nza a nati a sa reh a hwana.<verse eid="2PE 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Ta lisa alindeh Nnoh tasa tuma alindeh a ŋoh ta a bu na amohnoh na su ma aki wina Nnoh tasa Yeso Ada ambohroh.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tuma Ata Nza A zohhoh Na amboh Tufa Kristi Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Nnoh nimeh wuwana a ŋoh kǝ nga reh awumu amboh ata mbohroh nza meh kira ma inziyo reh nambri la meh ti gu agohsoh ikata Nnoh. Awumu mboh reh nambri a bu ambohroh tsifa la mbohroh meh wina Yeso kristi gaga. a bu ŋoh mi a fi reh a ba meh ti bu avohvoh nimeh agba a ŋoh tasa lisa alindeh a ŋoh. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Ma aki wohroh reh Nnoh kǝ nga reh ajija ngǝnga ata ta ka a bleh a gya la ŋoh wa a nati nga reh reh, la ma aki awumu ngǝnga amboh wohroh reh meh nati nvara lofona ata nza a nati a ba ma inziyo reh, bu amboh dohsohna na Nnoh, tasa za a ba la meh ti ŋoh ta a gafa biroh agohsoh a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="2PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Ma ikpi tsifa ata areh, lisa yiyina nnoh ti mishi nnoh awumu alilehndeh na nga agohsoh amohnoh reh; na lisa alindeh anzoh reh ti mishi lomo anzoh; <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />ma ikpi lomo amohnoh reh mishi nnoh de noh ikpi amohnoh alindeh. Ma ikpi de ikpi amohnoh reh, mishi nnoh de noh ikpi ahroh wuwa nnoh. Ma ikpi de ikpi ahroh reh, mishi nnoh biroh agohsoh alindeh Nnoh reh; <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />ma ikpi lisa biroh agohsoh Nnoh, lisa kira nnoh na atsi mboh. Ma ikpi kira atsi mboh za, kira. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Nza ni bu noh na agohsoh amboh ata areh gaga, wina noh Ada Yeso Kristi ata nza ni bu noh na wohroh reh a nati a de noh a te amboh yiyina tasa za lomo amohnoh ata Yeso Kristi a nati a zohhoh. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Akyo ata neh nza a bu na agohsoh ika ata areh kpeh, ŋoh reh ka a nza atsifi kpeh ha ka a nza atsifi a na gbugba kpeh, a te kohhroh na hwara ata mata ka a hwara ŋoh anyi na kpakpana a ŋoh mboh ata kiri reh. <verse eid="2PE 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Nza ka a bu dehreh, mohnoh atsi mya mboh, ti lisa fi noh ikpi keh nnoh ti shi wuwana nnoh ma ikpi fi tasa seh ata Nnoh ta ka a lisa nnoh reh, nza ni lisa noh dehreh, ni nati mishi hwa nnoh kyar kpeh. <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />Ma aki wohroh reh ma a nati a sa noh na ivoh afri ma atsi niye nimeh afiya tuma atono ata Ada ambohroh tasa Yeso Kristi ata nza a nati a sa reh a hwana reh.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Tsifa ata areh, meh nati kǝ kohnoh nnoh awumu amboh ata areh na tutu, mohnoh za ti wina mboh nnoh, ni kǝ wuwana nnoh nimeh tsana a zizi ata ti kǝ sa nnoh reh. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Na nza amya, a zohhoh mya nza ni tre bu na fene reh, a zohhoh meh ti kǝ leh kohnoh nnoh na awumu amboh areh, <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />tsifa la meh wina kǝ ba hwiri meh ti fufa itoh ata kwo reh gya na ni nda, tswanza Ada ambohroh Yeso, ta ka a tsana meh a kate pelele reh. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Nza a bu dehreh meh nati shi wuwana meh ti nza la ni de noh awumu ata nza a bu nimeh agohsoh amohnoh mboh reh ni tutu ha neh mya meh kwo.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">amboh Ata Ta Maka A nza Agba Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Mbohroh timi bleh noh la Ada ambohroh Yeso Kristi a bu na wuwana. Timi bleh noh za la a nati a gyuru a ba inziyo areh. Timi leh bleh noh kakranda huru tsifa ata nza anyi na kohnoh amboh lomo kpeh. Mbohroh neh timi leh bleh noh andromboh ata meh nza na iyo ambohroh. Mbohroh ni ikpi ambohroh timi nza la Ada Yeso a bu agba. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Na ameh ata ta ka sa agba tasa zohhoh anyi na Nnoh Ada reh mbohroh za timi yama Ma huru, Na ameh ata Agba Nnoh ata nza a bu Agba ata nza a keh Agba a buti bleh la, &lt;&lt;Areh a bu Amehreh amya mi, ata mya nza ni kira na a ŋoh gaga, agohsoh amya a nza nana a ŋoh gaga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Mbohroh na ikpi ambohroh meh sehreh agba ata areh ata nza anyi inza na ameh ata meh ti kǝ bu na a ŋoh ma agbohgboh atsi zanana. <verse eid="2PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Tsifa amboh ata areh nambri ma nga reh wuwa agohsoh ma ikpi tsifa amboh sa tohmoh nyi na Nnoh a bleh reh reh, a nati a zohhoh ti te nnoh ve na tsifa ata areh tsifa la ta a bu tswanza afitila ata ta zana atsifi a tswa atsi yanda ibi, na ameh akpukpa nerebi kǝ zana kate ba nnoh ma agohsoh amohnoh. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Wina nza noh la nza anyi jiji reh, meh kohnoh la akyo ambohroh anyi a nati a wina bleh andromboh ata nza na a bu ŋa gyaa nimeh amgbasho Nnoh reh kpeh. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Sa tsifa Nnoh Bleh a ka mishi anyi na kohnoh agohsoh kyangwri kpeh, neh a ka bu Huru Nnoh mi ka aniye ma agohsoh kyangwri mboh masa a sa a bleh tohmoh ata mboh nza ma a sa anyi na Nnoh.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">amboh Tsana Ata Huru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh ata huru tsifa mboh za tama a yama ma hohroh kyangwri na kiri, tswanza amboh tsana ata huru tsifa za nza ma a nati a yama nimeh amohnoh reh. Ma a nati a de tsana anyi a ba ata nza bu zizi kpeh, mata a tsana kyangwri mboh huru tsifa ata nza a nati a nasa mboh, mata a tana Ada, ata ŋoh nza a sa fene amoh reh. Tsifa wohroh reh Nnoh a nati a lofo mboh na gbugbo. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Kyangwri mboh gaga ma a nati a tufa agohsoh amoh mboh ata nza nana ata nza a bu na sa kpeh. Tsifa amoh za mgbiri kyangwri ma a nati a rina aki ata nza bu zizi reh. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Nimeh kira ikpi amoh reh amboh tsana ata huru tsifa reh ma a nati a kira la ti nga mboh nnoh hungroh gaga, la mata a tsana noh kakranda ata nza bu zizi kpeh reh. Tama a shimba mboh akpi na kpikpi ŋoh reh, la lofona amoh a leh a bana mboh.<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh za na kiri, nza tama ka kpakpana reh, Nnoh tana ka ata mboh kpeh, ŋoh neh tana ka a fira mboh a sangra a na nimeh afiya shira. Ka a lafa mboh nimeh tsiyo ata nza aniye gaga, ata nza bu shini ma mata a leh a bana ibi hwra akpi amoh. <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />Na kiri reh za, Nnoh tana nga kyangwri abibi mboh iya ma inziyo areh. Nnoh tana a tohmoh amwo ka a su a hama inziyo reh nambri. amboh ata nza ma a leke tufa Nnoh reh maka a lofona nimeh amwo reh. Nnoh neh ka a sa Anuhu kyangwri hwra akpi tufa yehlehleh reh a hwana mboh ma mgbiri kyangwri atehrehkifi na aniye reh. <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />Nza Nnoh reh ka a lofo akpokpo afiya afiya Sodom tasa Gomora na shira ata nza afya mboh a te atoh shira, a lisa dehreh la mbohroh timi nza andromboh ata nza ma a nati a lisa ma amboh ata ma a tufa Nnoh kpeh reh. <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />Tasa za Nnoh ka a sa Lotu kyangwri tufa yehlehleh reh a hwana, Lotu reh ka a te gofo la kyangwri Sodom mboh reh ma a tufa akpi Nnoh reh kpeh. <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />Kyangwri tufa yehlehleh a tuma ma hohroh agugu kyangwri reh, a tuma a leh a nza agugu amoh reh na tutu tasa za a leh a sehreh tsifa abibi amoh mboh reh, ma ikpi tsifa wohroh reh ka a kputu agohsoh a ŋoh la ma a tufa akpi Nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Nza ka bu dehreh reh, ma ikpi awumu ata ŋoh nza a lisa mbohroh timi nza reh, mbohroh meh wina la Nnoh a nati a wina sa amboh ata nza ma a bu na agohsoh a ŋoh reh a hwana anyi ma tsara mboh reh. Nnoh a nati a wina ha amboh ata nza ma a tufa yehlehleh kpeh reh la mata a bana ibi hwra akpi amoh. <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />Nnoh reh a nati nga iya ma amboh ata nza ma a kira na awumu abibi ma ikpi amoh reh, tasa amboh rina agbugba mboh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Mboh amboh tsana ata huru tsifa reh ma a bu na sa kpeh, tasa za maka a bu na wuwa ikpi. Maka a sohroh a nyiri mata a kya mara tohmoh mboh nza ma a yama ma inza reh kpeh. <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />Mboh mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh za ma a keh amboh tsana mboh reh wuwana tasa agba, mboh neh ma a sohroh nga mboh hwa tasa kya ma tohmoh Ada kpeh. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Kyangwri amboh areh neh, maka a leh a bleh tsifa rina ma ikpi awumu ata mboh ma a nza a wina kpeh reh. Mboh reh ma a tswanza iwo aye mboh reh, ma a bu na kohnoh kpeh, ma a leh a tufa andromboh ata agohsoh amoh nza a kira lisa reh, ata ma a mara mboh la mata a mla mboh a kwo were ma. Ma a nati a lofona za tswanza iwo aye mboh.<verse eid="2PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />Tswanza mboh nza ma nga mgbiri mboh iya reh, mboh za ma a nati a wa iya. Ma a gu wa tasa inyo na atsitsi fi noh la mboh reh ma a leh a nza nana. A nati a te mboh na abibi tasa na sa. Ma a nati a nza nana atsi leh landa amoh reh tasa za ma a nati a bu nimeh leh wa na amohnoh ma atsi dohsohna amohnoh reh. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Ma a nati a bu na kohnoh leh ahohndoh na ifiya akyo mboh na tutu, ma a nati a kohhoh na lisa awumu abibi kpeh. Ma a nati a leh a landa amboh ata agohsoh amoh nza a wuwana kpeh reh la mata a hwa nimeh nga agohsoh amoh. Mata bu amboh te iyo mboh. Ma a nati a wa iya tsifa awumu abibi ata mboh nza ma a lisa reh. <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Ma a yi aki ata a zizi reh ata, maka a gyuru a tufa aki Balamu ata nza bu amehreh Beyor, ata ka a kira ta a hunji firoh a ŋoh anyi ma aki agugu. <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Nnoh neh ka a hwa ŋoh ma ikpi kpakpana a ŋoh reh. Nyama a ŋoh ata kǝ hehreh tsifa nza kpeh reh ka atsifa tswanza kyangwri, a ka a ha kyangwri sa tohmoh reh lisa ndohmoh abibi a ŋoh reh.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />amboh tsana ata huru tsifa mboh reh ma a tswanza amwo ata nza ka a kate anyi ma inzi ata kǝ hwara reh, ka a tswanza avereh ata inyo nza ka afo reh, meh bleh zizi la Nnoh a leh a lisa atsifi a bana mboh nimeh shini kpehkpehreh. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Kyangwri amboh ata areh, ma atsi sesenge tasa bleh tsifa abibi amoh, tasa agohsoh amoh ata fa awumu nana ata ka a de sa a ba mboh kpeh, maka kira la mata a landa amboh ata ma a hehreh a yanda kpeh na ta amboh agugu mboh reh. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />amboh tsana ata huru tsifa mboh reh maka a bleh kyangwri mboh a gya la, ma a nati a wina lisa awumu mboh reh nambri, mboh na ikpi amoh neh ma a bu ahwra mboh ma atsi lisa awumu abibi reh. Kyangwri a bu ahwra na andromboh ata nza a keh wuwana a ŋoh. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />amboh tsana ata huru tsifa reh ma a hunji tsana reh ma ikpi Ada ambohroh Yeso kristi, ata nza a sa reh a hwana reh. Tsifa wohroh reh, ma a za a lisa abibi awumu ata amboh inziyo mboh maka a lisa reh kpeh. Wuwana ata awumu abibi reh a za a bu ma ikpi amoh za kpeh. nehnehreh neh ma a gyuru a leh a lisa awumu abibi reh yama. Nza ma a lisa dehreh reh, awumu abibi reh a nati a keh wuwana amoh, kyangwri amboh ata areh, tuma amoh ata nyina reh a nati a keh ata jiji reh abibi. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />A nati a keh zohhoh la kyangwri amboh ata areh ma a hehreh a wina aki alindeh Nnoh reh kpeh anyi jiji reh kpeh, ma a keh mboh zohhoh. Mboh neh nza ma a wina aki reh, maka a gyuru a ba amoh na nyina, ma a za a tufa aki Nnoh ata ma ta ka a tsana mboh reh za kpeh. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Andromboh ata nza ma a lisa reh, a ba yehlehleh na kakranda amboh ata reh la, &lt;&lt;Ava ka a kuye ta a gyuru a fene kuye a ŋoh,&gt;&gt;tasa za &lt;&lt;Atambri afiya ata nza ma a wra ŋoh, ka a gyuru a na na a leh a kpato ma mbamblasa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Ibi Ata Ada A nati Ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Iza amya mboh, areh a bu amgbasho amya ata na afri ŋoh ba na amohnoh. Meh ŋa amgbasho reh ba nnoh na afri ma amoh la ta kohnoh nnoh aki kohnoh mboh alindeh nambri. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />Meh kira ti kohnoh nnoh tsifa mboh amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh mboh nza ma a zanana ma ta ka a bleh reh tasa tsifa kpi ashotoh ata Ada ambohroh ata sa reh hwana ta ka a bleh ma aniye amboh hende hwra tsifa nana Yeso a bleh reh. <verse eid="2PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Meh kira ti jiji wina noh la, nimeh ibi amboh trina ŋoh amboh yohhoh ma a nati a ba, ma a nati a leh ayoho ma ta ka a tufa aki agugu amoh. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />Ma a nati a luhu la, &lt;&lt;Ŋoh gyuru &lt;ba&gt; ta ka a bleh a gya reh ama? Nyi avoh kiri Ada ambohroh mboh ma ta ka a kwo reh, awumu mboh reh ma a leh a na tswanza ta ka a bu nyi avoh ma ta ka a jiji a lisa inziyo reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Mboh neh ma a gu a te kohhroh na nyi ŋoh la anyi amehmeh ŋoh inza mboh tama a yama ma aniye bleh feh masa a lisa inziyo a kate anyi ma amwo tasa amwo ka a goh ŋoh <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />tana abu na amwo agba ata ma ta ka a lofo inziyo ata ameh wohroh reh, na ameh ata amwo ta ka a hama inziyo reh. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Na tsifa wohroh reh za inza tasa inziyo ma tuma bana lofona na shira, ma a shwa a gya bana ibi hwra akpi tasa lofona amboh ata nza ma a bu Nnoh a ŋoh kpeh reh.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Iza amya mboh kama gu ata areh te nnoh kohhroh kpeh: Na Ada ibi anyimbehreh a tswanza ahushi mboh dubu, tasa ahushi dubu ma tswanza ibi anyimbehreh. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />amboh tswa ma a bleh la, Ada ka a te yangru ma aki bleh tsifa a ŋoh gya kpeh. Ŋoh a bu na soh ivoh yira na amohnoh, neh la kyangwri mboh nambri mata ata aki kpakpana amoh mboh.<verse eid="2PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Ibi ata Ada neh a nati a ba tswanza ayuhu. Inza a nati a lalana a bleh nza gbalala tana ahwra; awumu ata nza ma a lisa inza tasa inzi na wohroh a nati afya a te tushira, tasa inziyo na awumu ata nza a yama nimeh a nati a bleh.<verse eid="2PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Nza awumu amboh areh nambri ma a nati a lofona dehreh, a ka bu kyangwri ika atamaa ŋa a zohhoh mbohroh meh ti bu? A zohhoh ti tuma noh na huru zanana ata Nnoh, <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />Nza ni tuma bana nnoh ibi ata Nnoh tasa ni kira nnoh ta ba fifi. Ibi wohroh a nati a ba na druhu inza na shira, tasa awumu nza ma a lisa inza a nati afya a te tushira. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Ma ikpi tsifa bleh gya a ŋoh ata nza meh tuma bana inza afeh tasa inziyo afeh, atsi ata lisa yehlehleh nza a bu ma a huru.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Nza a bu dehreh, iziza amya mboh, mohnoh nza ni tuma bana nnoh ibi reh, lisa nza noh mata kama a hunji noh na kpakpana kpeh tasa ti tuma noh alindeh na a ŋoh. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Nza nnoh la soh ivoh yira Ada reh a bu aki hunji nvara, tswanza atsi ambohroh Ablusu ta ka a ŋa a ba nnoh na lomo ata Nnoh nza a nga ŋoh reh. <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />A ŋa ika wohroh nimeh amgbasho a ŋoh mboh reh nambri, ka tsifa ma ikpi tsifa amboh wohroh. Amgbasho a ŋoh mboh reh a ka a bu na tsifa amboh anyi nza ma a bu na iya wina ŋoh, ata amboh ata nza ma wina lomo kpeh maka a de a chakafa, tswanza ma ta ka a lisa ma amgbasho amboh jiji ŋoh reh, ma a nati a lofona.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Nza a bu dehreh mohnoh iziza amya mboh neh, mohnoh nza ni jiji wina noh ata areh, lisa nza noh feh, la tsana ata huru tsifa ata amboh agugu mboh reh ta kama a fira agohsoh amohnoh ti ta nnoh aki nvara amohnoh reh kpeh. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Rya nnoh tohmoh nimeh lisa alindeh tasa lomo ata Ada ambohroh ata sa reh hwana Yeso kristi. Nga agba ta a bu na a ŋoh nehnehreh tasa ata tuma atono! Avoh dehreh.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>